      "dot": "emerald",
      "title": "Framework Selection Guide",
      "items": [
        "Enterprise production with NVIDIA GPUs → NVIDIA NIM (optimized containers, support, monitoring)",
        "High throughput with KV cache optimization → NVIDIA Dynamo (disaggregated serving, intelligent routing)",
        "Distributed inference at scale → Ray Serve + vLLM / LoRA multi-tenancy → AIBrix",
        "Cost optimization with AWS silicon → AWS Neuron + Inferentia2 (40-70% cheaper than GPUs)"
      ]
